ation-macro-icon"></span>
<div class=3D"confluence-information-macro-body">
<p>The installation will overwrite all existing data on the target drive.</=
p>
</div>
</div>
<ol start=3D"1">
<li>
<p>Connect the prepared USB memory stick to the target device and switch th=
e target device on.<br></p></li>
<li>
<p>Select one of the following options from the boot menu:</p><span class=
