ta-media-id=3D"84c23c9a-9afc-4302-989b-c326f07ed3f6" data-media-type=3D"fil=
e" height=3D"317"></span>
<p></p>
<p><br>
The installation of IGEL OS 12 starts.</p><span class=3D"confluence-embedde=
d-file-wrapper image-center-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size"><img c=
lass=3D"confluence-embedded-image image-center" alt=3D"image-20240927-15310=
6.png" width=3D"468" loading=3D"lazy" src=3D"4a4ea44a93e326287cb5051a2bd429=
0df2190fc7a817260a42d3fef68c39ba2a" data-image-src=3D"https://igel-jira.atl=
assian.net/wiki/download/attachments/73302531/image-20240927-153106.png?ver=
sion=3D1&amp;modificationDate=3D1727451067417&amp;cacheVersion=3D1&amp;api=
=3Dv2" data-height=3D"561" data-width=3D"870" data-unresolved-comment-count=
=3D"0" data-linked-resource-id=3D"179437775" data-linked-resource-version=
=3D"1" data-linked-resource-type=3D"attachment" data-linked-resource-defaul=
t-alias=3D"image-20240927-153106.png" data-base-url=3D"https://igel-jira.at=
lassian.net/wiki" data-linked-resource-content-type=3D"image/png" data-link=
ed-resource-container-id=3D"73302531" data-linked-resource-container-versio=
n=3D"21" data-media-id=3D"dc7a1130-550e-4401-9d6c-b52e7fe5fb27" data-media-=
type=3D"file" height=3D"301"></span>
<p></p>
<p><br>
The installation program will set up IGEL OS 11 on the target drive. If you=
 see the success&nbsp;message, the installation is complete.</p><span class=
=3D"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper image-center-wrapper confluence-embedd=
ed-manual-size"><img class=3D"confluence-embedded-image image-center" alt=
=3D"image-20240927-153552.png" width=3D"468" loading=3D"lazy" src=3D"d073e0=
af7416d00e3225232a0f9e18dce0ebb3dbb89c1ca76196f9c30edf603c" data-image-src=
=3D"https://igel-jira.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/73302531/imag=
e-20240927-153552.png?version=3D1&amp;modificationDate=3D1727451353723&amp;=
cacheVersion=3D1&amp;api=3Dv2" data-height=3D"561" data-width=3D"872" data-=
unresolved-comment-count=3D"0" data-linked-resource-id=3D"179568792" data-l=
inked-resource-version=3D"1" data-linked-resource-type=3D"attachment" data-=
linked-resource-default-alias=3D"image-20240927-153552.png" data-base-url=
=3D"https://igel-jira.atlassian.net/wiki" data-linked-resource-content-type=
=3D"image/png" data-linked-resource-container-id=3D"73302531" data-linked-r=
esource-container-version=3D"21" data-media-id=3D"43a88826-8326-462d-bdfa-3=
5c165ec98e0" data-media-type=3D"file" height=3D"300"></span>
<p></p>
<p></p></li>
<li>
<p>Click <strong>Shutdown</strong>.</p><span class=3D"confluence-embedded-f=
ile-wrapper image-center-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size"><img clas=
s=3D"confluence-embedded-image image-center" alt=3D"image-20240927-153634.p=
ng" width=3D"468" loading=3D"lazy" src=3D"3bf34be5646e5afbcaefea948066fbbad=
fd411f8ba1dc6bf199a1de8521afb34" data-image-src=3D"https://igel-jira.atlass=
ian.net/wiki/download/attachments/73302531/image-20240927-153634.png?versio=
n=3D1&amp;modificationDate=3D1727451396012&amp;cacheVersion=3D1&amp;api=3Dv=
2" data-height=3D"561" data-width=3D"872" data-unresolved-comment-count=3D"=
0" data-linked-resource-id=3D"179634402" data-linked-resource-version=3D"1"=
 data-linked-resource-type=3D"attachment" data-linked-resource-default-alia=
s=3D"image-20240927-153634.png" data-base-url=3D"https://igel-jira.atlassia=
n.net/wiki" data-linked-resource-content-type=3D"image/png" data-linked-res=
ource-container-id=3D"73302531" data-linked-resource-container-version=3D"2=
1" data-media-id=3D"b522dac8-1419-477f-9719-8b3774a27300" data-media-type=
=3D"file" height=3D"300"></span>
<p></p>
<p></p></li>
<li>
<p>Read out the image from your device to deploy it on the units.</p></li>
</ol>
<div class=3D"confluence-information-macro confluence-information-macro-not=
e">
<span class=3D"aui-icon aui-icon-small aui-iconfont-warning confluence-info=
rmation-macro-icon"></span>
<div class=3D"confluence-information-macro-body">
<p>DO NOT BOOT THE EXACT FACTORY IMAGE THAT IS INTENDED FOR DEPLOYMENT ON Y=
OUR DEVICES! ALL DEVICES TO WHICH THIS IMAGE HAS BEEN DEPLOYED WOULD SHARE =
ONE AND THE SAME UNIT ID. AS A RESULT, YOUR DEVICES WOULD BE PRACTICALLY UN=
USABLE.</p>
<p>If you want to test the factory image before its deployment, transfer it=
 to your target medium first and then boot the image on the machine on whic=
h you created it, or any other test machine. The important thing is that th=
e factory image that will be mass-deployed to your units has not been boote=
d before.</p>
</div>
</div>
<div class=3D"confluence-information-macro confluence-information-macro-tip=
">
<span class=3D"aui-icon aui-icon-small aui-iconfont-approve confluence-info=
rmation-macro-icon"></span>
<div class=3D"confluence-information-macro-body">
<p>The maximum size of the image created by the IGEL OS Creator (OSC) is 64=
 GiB. Therefore, only the first 64 GiB of your storage medium is needed. If=
 your devices have larger storage, this will allow for faster deployment.</=
p>
</div>
</div>
<p></p>
<ol start=3D"13">
<li>
<p>To ensure the integrity of the image, you should create checksums of the=
 original image and the deployed images and then compare them. For details,=
 see&nbsp;<a class=3D"external-link" href=3D"https://kb.igel.com/en/igel-os=
/11.10.250/igel-endpoint-partners-ensuring-image-integrity-wi" rel=3D"nofol=
low">IGEL Endpoint Partners: Ensuring Image Integrity with a Checksum</a>.<=
/p></li>
</ol>
<p></p>
<ol start=3D"14">
<li>
<p>Proceed as appropriate:</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>If&nbsp;<strong>Reset after first boot</strong> is inactive, you can dep=
loy the images on the units and roll them out straight away. The deployment=
 should include a comparison of the checksums.</p></li>
<li>
<p>If <strong>Reset after first boot</strong> has been activated,&nbsp;depl=
oy the images on the units and continue with&nbsp;<a href=3D"#Unit-Testing"=
 rel=3D"nofollow">Unit Testing</a>.</p></li>
<li>
<p>If <strong>Automatically shutdown at first boot</strong> has been activa=
ted, deploy the images on the units and continue with <a href=3D"#Automatic=
UnitTesting" rel=3D"nofollow">Automatic Unit Testing</a>.</p></li>
</ul></li>
</ol>
<h3 id=3D"HowtoDeployIGELOS12withIGELOSCreator(OSC)-UnitTestingUnit-Testing=
">Unit Testing<span class=3D"confluence-anchor-link" id=3D"HowtoDeployIGELO=
S12withIGELOSCreator(OSC)-Unit-Testing"><span class=3D"confluence-anchor-li=
nk" id=3D"Unit-Testing"></span></span></h3>
<p>Perform the following procedure on the original device and every unit on=
 which the image has been deployed.&nbsp;</p>
<div class=3D"confluence-information-macro confluence-information-macro-not=
e">
<span class=3D"aui-icon aui-icon-small aui-iconfont-warning confluence-info=
rmation-macro-icon"></span>
<div class=3D"confluence-information-macro-body">
<p>The first boot test MUST take place with each unit BEFORE it is rolled o=
ut. (Otherwise, the device would present the green test screen on the first=
 boot instead of the IGEL Setup Assistant.)</p>
</div>
</div>
<ol start=3D"1">
<li>
<p>Start the device and review the green test screen.</p><span class=3D"con=
fluence-embedded-file-wrapper image-center-wrapper confluence-embedded-manu=
al-size"><img class=3D"confluence-embedded-image confluence-content-image-b=
order image-center" width=3D"468" loading=3D"lazy" src=3D"681dabb8de17461ba=
52e6f19ba60c61c0f597fc6e61a11e76f126798ddbcdbb8" data-image-src=3D"https://=
igel-jira.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/73302531/image-2024-3-22_=
11-56-32.png?version=3D1&amp;modificationDate=3D1716364686245&amp;cacheVers=
ion=3D1&amp;api=3Dv2" data-height=3D"769" data-width=3D"1025" data-unresolv=
ed-comment-count=3D"0" data-linked-resource-id=3D"73308872" data-linked-res=
ource-version=3D"1" data-linked-resource-type=3D"attachment" data-linked-re=
source-default-alias=3D"image-2024-3-22_11-56-32.png" data-base-url=3D"http=
s://igel-jira.atlassian.net/wiki" data-linked-resource-content-type=3D"imag=
e/png" data-linked-resource-container-id=3D"73302531" data-linked-resource-=
container-version=3D"21" data-media-id=3D"0bf152bd-20db-468c-85a6-d60363beb=
71a" data-media-type=3D"file" height=3D"351"></span>
<p></p></li>
<li>
<p>Click&nbsp;<strong>OK</strong>.<br>
You can access IGEL OS in a regular way and perform your tests.<br></p></li=
>
<li>
<p>Shut the device down.<br>
The device is ready for roll-out.</p></li>
</ol>
<p></p>
<h3 id=3D"HowtoDeployIGELOS12withIGELOSCreator(OSC)-AutomaticUnitTestingAut=
omaticUnitTesting">Automatic Unit Testing<span class=3D"confluence-anchor-l=
ink" id=3D"HowtoDeployIGELOS12withIGELOSCreator(OSC)-AutomaticUnitTesting">=
<span class=3D"confluence-anchor-link" id=3D"AutomaticUnitTesting"></span><=
/span></h3>
<p>When&nbsp;<strong>Reset after first boot</strong> and&nbsp;<strong>Autom=
atically shutdown at first boot</strong>&nbsp;has been enabled, the device =
writes a log file on its first boot and then shuts down automatically.&nbsp=
;</p>
<p>Your test routine must perform the following procedure:</p>
<ol start=3D"1">
<li>
<p>Start the device.<br>
The device will perform a check and write the results to a file&nbsp;on the=
 first VFAT partition of the device's storage medium.&nbsp;The file format =
is JSON, and the file name is&nbsp;<code>check.log</code>. After a few seco=
nds, the machine shuts down automatically. During the uptime, the green tes=
t screen is shown.</p><span class=3D"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper image=
-center-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size"><img class=3D"confluence-e=
mbedded-image image-center" alt=3D"thumbnail_image.png" width=3D"468" loadi=
ng=3D"lazy" src=3D"9dfa3ababdce0574fa2d36ada36e02318eabd3701bd7530f7ef02ece=
5ff9f79f" data-image-src=3D"https://igel-jira.atlassian.net/wiki/download/a=
ttachments/73302531/thumbnail_image.png?version=3D1&amp;modificationDate=3D=
1727353372442&amp;cacheVersion=3D1&amp;api=3Dv2" data-height=3D"864" data-w=
idth=3D"1537" data-unresolved-comment-count=3D"0" data-linked-resource-id=
=3D"177930270" data-linked-resource-version=3D"1" data-linked-resource-type=
=3D"attachment" data-linked-resource-default-alias=3D"thumbnail_image.png" =
data-base-url=3D"https://igel-jira.atlassian.net/wiki" data-linked-resource=
-content-type=3D"image/png" data-linked-resource-container-id=3D"73302531" =
data-linked-resource-container-version=3D"21" data-media-id=3D"c6ffb650-5fa=
a-4b4a-a19c-8a999bb25069" data-media-type=3D"file" height=3D"262"></span>
<p><br></p></li>
</ol>
<p></p>
<ol start=3D"2">
<li>
<p>Get the file <code>check.log</code> from the&nbsp;first VFAT partition o=
f the storage medium and analyze it. The contents of the file are described=
 below.</p></li>
</ol>
<h4 id=3D"HowtoDeployIGELOS12withIGELOSCreator(OSC)-ExampleContentofcheck.l=
og">Example Content of check.log</h4>
<div class=3D"code panel pdl" style=3D"border-width: 1px;">
<div class=3D"codeContent panelContent pdl">
<pre class=3D"syntaxhighlighter-pre" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=3D"brush=
: java; gutter: false; theme: Confluence" data-theme=3D"Confluence">{
  "product": "Standard PC",
  "serial": "12345678",
  "product_id": "UC1-LX",
  "version": "12.4.1",
  "bootmode": "UEFI Secure Boot",
  "flashsize": "7688 MB",
  "date": "2024-09-26, 08:08 AM",
  "status": "SUCCESS",
  "log": ""
}</pre>
</div>
</div>
<p></p>
